Hello Takashi Iwai,

I tested your latest snapshot and it did not detect the 6 channel audio.  I=
 have attached the output of alsa-info for analysis.  The original patch th=
at I submitted did not detect the coaxial/optical SPDIF interface on this b=
oard.  I've been running with the=20
ALC662_3ST_6ch_DIG method instead of ALC662_3ST_6ch which was in the origin=
al patch.  The _DIG method now shows my spdif interface correctly and my 6 =
channel analog audio is also working correctly.  I do not have a receiver t=
o test the coaxial/optical output, though I suspect it works correctly.  I'=
ve attached a new patch which uses the _DIG method as I believe its the mor=
e proper method to use for this hardware layout.

Thanks,
Gus Bourg

